ate Oil Pumps\">启动石油泵<sup>a</sup></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Purge_Hatcheries\" title=\"Purge Hatcheries\">净化孵化巢</a>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Destroy_Transmission_Network\" title=\"Destroy Transmission Network\">摧毁传输网络<sup>a</sup></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Eradicate_Automaton_Forces\" title=\"Eradicate Automaton Forces\">歼灭机器人部队</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Terminate_Illegal_Broadcast\" title=\"Terminate Illegal Broadcast\">终止非法广播</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Destroy_Rogue_Research_Station\" title=\"Destroy Rogue Research Station\">摧毁失控研究站</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SEAF_Artillery\" title=\"SEAF Artillery\">SEAF 火炮</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SEAF_SAM_Site\" title=\"SEAF SAM Site\">SEAF 防空导弹阵地</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Radar\" title=\"Mobile Radar\">移动雷达</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Radar_Station\" title=\"Radar Station\">雷达站</a>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Spore_Spewer\" title=\"Spore Spewer\">孢子喷涌者</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Cognitive_Disruptor\" title=\"Cognitive Disruptor\">认知干扰器</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Warp_Gateway\" title=\"Warp Gateway\">跃迁门</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>地图尺寸增大为半径 300 米（约 0.283 km²）<br />引入<a href=\"/wiki/Optional_Objectives\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Optional Objectives\">可选目标</a>\n<p>以虫巢 / 机器人前哨站 / 光能族营地的形式引入敌人刷新区（前哨站）<a href=\"/wiki/Terminid_Nest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Terminid Nest\">虫巢</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Automaton_Outpost\" title=\"Automaton Outpost\">机器人前哨站</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Illuminate_Encampment\" title=\"Illuminate Encampment\">光能族营地</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><b><big>0%</big></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>3\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty\" title=\"Difficulty\"><img alt=\"Medium Difficulty Icon.svg\" src=\"./assets/mechanics/difficulty/Medium_Difficulty_Icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"34\" height=\"16\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a> <span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">普通</a></span>\n</th>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2, 4\n<p>合计：6</p>\n</td>\n<td>主要：1-3<p>可选：2</p>\n</td>\n<td>5-9 合计<p>3-6 轻型</p><p>2-3 中型</p>\n</td>\n<td><a hre